    "diagnosis": "The FIFO emits three extra valid cycles (13\u201315) after the input window ends at cycle 13, indicating that the read pointer or the output-valid latch is not being cleared when the frame is dropped or the FIFO becomes empty. The extra assertions occur because mem_read_data_valid_reg retains a stale \u20181\u2019 after the last accepted frame, so the output stage continues to drive m_axis_tvalid high even though no new data has been written.",
    "display_ids": [
